    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20586" root="سلى" body-key="s">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَلَتْ</span></b>  <i>She</i> (a camel, TA, [or a ewe or
goat,]) <i>cast forth her secundine</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَاهَا</span>). (K,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>She</i> (a ewe, or goat,) <i>became fat.</i> (K
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سلو</span>, and TA in the present art.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استلت</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سمنًا</span> [i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمْنًا</span>] <i>She collected</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سمن</span> [or <i>clarified
butter</i>]. (TA. [See also 8 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سلأ</span>.])

